&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMfomBt17IVRWSHi3EmcGj2WIPSCNt8tDcVrKgi6x6qEg&oe=6ADF554C"}, {"file_name": "04_Flexer_Action_2560x1440.png", "id": "2184872072072152", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831299_2184872075405485_4008272742366392584_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YWo7z1TcTl0Q7kNvwE8sbvj&_nc_oc=AdqLOCow_l-Skj9KmKxn0BWKQRxLOz988hUn7RVPoOMUr3-88Y9KyNPlDeOus6ew0yE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP783mw0ctTjmOqkEJkHufV3LPCtaW02dBW6_EbCG1YjA&oe=6ADF4653"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Punchable Face", "keywords": ["boxing", "punching", "arcade", "stress", "fitness"], "long_description": "Sometimes you just want to punch a face.\n\n**Punchable Face** is a simple VR stress toy built around one idea: choose an irritating character, step into their world, and go to town.\n\n## Choose Your Face\n\n### The Barker\nA grinning carnival loudmouth waiting for you under the lights.\n\n### The Flexer\nA smug car-meet regular surrounded by modified cars and nighttime parking-lot lights.\n\n## Hit Harder\n\nEvery valid punch is measured using your controller speed and converted into an **Impact Score from 100 to 999**.\n\nChase your Session Best and watch each character react with movement, haptics, impact audio, facial reactions, and accumulating redness that slowly fades when you stop.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two characters with unique environments\n- Physics-based punch detection\n- Impact Score and Session Best\n- Hand-specific haptics\n- Reactive faces and visual feedback\n- Standing or seated play\n- No locomotion, rounds, health bars, or complicated progression\n\n**Pick a face. Punch it.**", "short_description": "Pick an annoying face, put on your gloves, and start swinging. Punchable Face is a simple VR stress toy with satisfying impacts, haptics, scoring, and two ridiculous characters to pummel."}]}, "developer_name":